#Vacation Time is Over 🍹
(for 100 Word Stories podcast, submitted)

Twas a strange sight to see indeed. An old wizard shuffling down a beach. He trudged through the deep sand looking much like a man who would much rather be elsewhere. Someplace with sidewalks. If one was to stare hard enough, at just the right angle, they could nearly see the proverbial steam tweeting from his ears. 

With a grin of pure enjoyment, he swaggered up to a lounge chair that was trying desperately to hide beneath a large colorful umbrella, “Vacation time is over. Get back to work.” 

Death sighed above his fruity drink, complete with little umbrella, “Daaaaamn!” 

